      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The talk will be a summary of the motivation and problem encountered while setting a global shared account database for the Mageia distribution infrastructure, focusing on LDAP and the issues around software integration, patches and directory synchronisation.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
